Package: com.colindavidr.amazondark
Name: AmazonDark
Version: 5.460.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: True dark mode for the Amazon Shopping app - a real dark theme, not a colour inversion. Dark Reader themes web content, Amazon's own native dark components handle chrome, and a ported Dark Reader colour engine covers UIKit and React Native surfaces. Icons, buttons, text, ads and backgrounds are corrected automatically, while product photos and artwork are protected. Includes optional White Background Taming, a dark cold-launch screen, and optional 120 Hz. Settings -> AmazonDark.
Maintainer: Colin Rioux
Author: Colin Rioux
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
Conflicts: com.yourname.amazondark
Replaces: com.yourname.amazondark
Icon: file:///Library/PreferenceBundles/ADPrefs.bundle/icon@3x.png
Homepage: https://github.com/colindavidr/Amazon-Dark
